{"actor":{"agent":"bell","host":"kite-win11","session":"bell-20260826-macro"},"event_digest":"c9d447517462301391ea98a7cd0edef1b053a8fa5418fa355ee37910f885f186","kind":"done","payload":{"done_mode":"authored","evidence":{"anchor_digest":null,"content_digest":"22475a50666bc6604582ecb3b8531c8b4eafa48d174adde41d551c883ba052af","evidence_id":"ev-macro-product-flow-t02-macro-domain","git_blob_oid":"db9d7cff6ac0e124cb5d06d691521e927e6c525a","media_type":"text/markdown","path":"evidence/macro-product-flow/t02-macro-domain.md","repo_id":"self"},"imported":false,"test_result":"# t02 macro token・catalog・合成契約\n\n- macro正本は既存Learning Route revisionのまま。新schema／新DBは追加していない。\n- `MacroInvocationTokens`はroute ID、exact versionまたはlatest追従、AI監視modeだけを保持する。\n- latest追従tokenにより、AI修復後のappend-only新版をdevice bindingの再保存なしで実行できる。\n- `MacroRouteComposer`は2件以上のCompiled／Verified sourceを選択順に連結し、同一game／environmentとedge連続性を既存`LearningRouteValidator`で検証する。\n- `HostMacroCatalog`はSQLiteの最新macro一覧、exact/latest解決、合成route appendを既存store上で提供する。\n- source macro revisionは変更しない。\n\n## focused\n\n- `MacroInvocationTokensTests`／`MacroRouteComposerTests`: 10件green。\n- `HostMacroCatalogTests`: 1件green。最新version一覧、合成、source履歴保持、SQLite復元を確認。\n"},"plan_key":"macro-product-flow","plan_version":"v1","previous_digest":"33fb21992201ad7c4b34b4e601b98be920a9ba964ab51e4af51bfa76b0027646","project_id":"OpenLogicool","provenance":null,"recorded_at":"2026-08-25T17:25:18.093Z","schema":"lattice.todo_event.v1","sequence":4,"task_id":"t02-macro-domain"}
